OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill start cloudy for most, though
OL,7,Frain turning increasingly patchy.
OL,8,FClear spells forming overnight, though
OL,9,Fa few showers also likely by the early
OL,10,Fhours, especially over Cumbria. Breezy
OL,11,Fto start but winds easing for a time
OL,12,Fovernight.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FGenerally Sunday promises to
OL,15,Fbe a brighter day than Saturday,
OL,16,Falthough a scattering of occasionally
OL,17,Fheavy showers are likely to feed
OL,18,Facross the region with a gusty
OL,19,Fsouthwesterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
