OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,6,Fand Tuesday look milder, though cloudy
OL,7,Fwith rain at times, some heavy. Windy
OL,8,Ffor a while too. A fresher, sunnier
OL,9,Fday's expected on Wednesday, with the
OL,10,Fchance of showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
